<blockquote>"In this, the year 2864, our monument marks Cross Fields, a place of exchange Pilipai. Here the glory of Sabor burns as bright as in any of the four cities. Long may bucolic freedom reign. Long may Pilipai live equal among one another. We are gods."</blockquote>
